#question(title: [Strict or non-strict inequality?], centered: true)[
  Let $f$ be a function with domain $RR$. One
  of these statements implies the other.
  Which one?

  + $display(forall M in RR comma thin exists N in RR " s.t. " x > N ==> f(x) > M)$
  + $display(forall M in RR comma thin exists N in RR " s.t. " x > N ==> f(x) >= M)$
]
